  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Rinse red lentils.\n• Peel potato and cut into bite-sized chunks. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-5bd25720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Add soffritto mix and cook until softened, 4-6 minutes.\n• Add ginger paste, Bengal curry paste (see ingredients) and tomato paste and cook, stirring until fragrant, 2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-9542f571.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir through the water, lentils, coconut milk and a pinch of salt.\n• Cover with a lid, reduce the heat to medium and cook, stirring occasionally, until the lentils have softened, 20-22 minutes.\n• In the last 2 minutes, remove the lid and stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. TIP: Add a splash of water if the sauce looks dry.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-ab86399e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cook potato in the saucepan of boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes.\n• Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to the potato. Season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-be9fa7b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sauce is cooking, preheat the grill to high. Transfer lentil mixture to a baking dish. Gently spread the mash over the lentil mixture with the back of a spoon. Grill the pie until lightly golden, 5-10 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, pick and roughly chop mint.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt and mint. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-dcafbaaf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Indian lentil dhal pie between bowls.\n• Top with mint yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/631fc9b2639d32e9c805ed23/step-5dcf1b9e.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
